# Purpose

This document defines the integration engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to establish architectural principles for connecting hubIO with external systems while preserving business integrity, security, scalability, and long-term maintainability.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Integration philosophy
* Integration architecture
* System boundaries
* External communication
* Integration governance
* Integration evolution

It intentionally excludes communication protocols, third-party SDKs, authentication providers, webhooks, and implementation-specific integration technologies, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to external system communication, ensuring integrations strengthen business capabilities without compromising architectural boundaries.

